.TH LORD 1 "November 2026" "ix"
.SH NAME
law, lawd, lord, lorde, lordhavemercy, lordylordydaddysforty \- ask the same god at different speeds
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B lord
.RI [ request ...]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Each command sends its arguments and piped input to
.BR gen (1).
.B NSH_PROGRAM
can name a file of instructions. The six commands request low, low,
medium, high, extra-high, and maximum reasoning effort respectively.
.SH EXAMPLE
.nf
printf 'one\\ntwo\\n' | law 'Continue the sequence.'
.fi
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR gen (1),
.BR LD (1)
